{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>ViuTV節目《晚吹》最新一集邀請嘉賓小美分享3歲喪父兼入住兒童之家的悲慘童年，揭露亡父疑涉黑社會及毒品活動的驚人背景。她憶述當年被迫與母親分離並過着猶如軍訓般嚴苛生活，每次通電都哭得撕心裂肺。這位擁有暗黑童年經歷的嘉賓隨即被網民極速起底，發現其真實身分竟是近期備受樂壇前輩力捧的實力派新人。</p>\n<p>ViuTV節目《晚吹 – 怨女俱樂部》最新一集邀請嘉賓小美分享3歲喪父兼入住兒童之家的悲慘童年，揭露亡父疑涉黑社會及毒品活動的驚人背景。她憶述當年被迫與母親分離並過着猶如軍訓般嚴苛生活，每次通電都哭得撕心裂肺。這位擁有暗黑童年經歷的嘉賓隨即被網民極速起底，發現其真實身分竟是近期備受樂壇前輩力捧的實力派新人。</p>\n<h2>《晚吹》小美於揭露亡父涉黑與地獄寄宿生活</h2>\n<p>小美在節目中透露原本家境富裕並聘有2名傭人，惟3歲時父親突然離世令生活遭逢巨變。她引述親戚說法指亡父生前從事與毒品有關偏門生意，出入更被尊稱大佬，而死因至今仍流傳吸食嗎啡或天台輕生等多個版本。失去經濟支柱後，母親無奈將年僅3歲及2歲的2姊弟送入兒童之家，小美形容長達5年寄宿生活猶如地獄，不但被逼吃下討厭食物，連吃剩飯菜亦要留待下一餐全部吃清。</p>\n<h2>悲慘嘉賓被起底真實身分為樂壇新人范明熙</h2>\n<p>節目播出後引發極大迴響，網民翻查資料發現小美其實是7月3日於灣仔舉辦新歌發布會正式出道女歌手范明熙。化名小V進軍樂壇並推出首支派台歌《隨便放閃》，發布會當日獲張佳添與韋綺珊及漢洋等多位重量級前輩現身力撐。面對前輩們一致給予極高評價，范明熙當場感動落淚，並公開感謝歌迷多年來一路陪伴，坦言會勇敢堅定地展現自己追求音樂夢想。</p>\n<h2>范明熙獲吳大強激讚行走CD更欲招為新抱</h2>\n<p>翻查范明熙入行前背景，她曾做過快餐店與茶餐廳及派傳單等基層工作，其後轉戰網絡直播平台憑甜美歌聲晉身台灣區100大主播行列。歌手吳大強在發布會上自爆是其忠實粉絲，大讚她人靚歌甜兼具備極高歌唱實力，更被眾人譽為行走CD。吳大強甚至在現場公開笑言自己有4個兒子可以介紹認識，直指有機會讓這位實力新人成為自己新抱。</p>\n<h2>網民震驚范明熙暗黑童年與甜美形象形成強烈反差</h2>\n<p>大批觀眾得知真相後紛紛湧入社交平台留言，對其身世與現況巨大反差感到無比震驚。有人留言表示「完全睇唔出佢經歷過咁多痛苦」，認為她能夠走出童年陰霾並堅持追夢非常勵志。亦有網民針對兒童之家嚴苛規矩表達不滿，直斥「逼小朋友食隔夜餸真係好唔人道」，並紛紛留言為她打氣，期望這位經歷過人生低谷樂壇新人能夠在音樂道路上繼續發光發亮。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367271747149034_10250050196ae9460e28a37.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"晚吹 范明熙 （圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367271747149034_10250050196ae9460e28a37.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367272055256577_5809150696ae94610cb4ef.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"晚吹 范明熙 （圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367272055256577_5809150696ae94610cb4ef.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367272297440222_18027228376ae9461351d65.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"晚吹 范明熙 （圖片來源：IG@vvvevila）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367272297440222_18027228376ae9461351d65.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@vvvevila）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367272618237063_18999037606ae94616670cf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"晚吹 范明熙 （圖片來源：IG@vvvevila）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367272618237063_18999037606ae94616670cf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@vvvevila）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367272761713077_432707256ae94617def14.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"晚吹 范明熙 （圖片來源：IG@vvvevila）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367272761713077_432707256ae94617def14.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@vvvevila）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367272942945505_6255881876ae9461997021.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"晚吹 范明熙 （圖片來源：IG@vvvevila）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367272942945505_6255881876ae9461997021.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@vvvevila）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367273083816600_1960154876ae9461b38e46.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"晚吹 范明熙 （圖片來源：IG@vvvevila）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367273083816600_1960154876ae9461b38e46.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@vvvevila）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367273295279966_17987372316ae9461d3307b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"晚吹 范明熙 （圖片來源：IG@vvvevila）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367273295279966_17987372316ae9461d3307b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@vvvevila）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367273445866495_6877125256ae9461e9f315.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"晚吹 范明熙 （圖片來源：IG@vvvevila）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367273445866495_6877125256ae9461e9f315.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@vvvevila）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367273596374684_17873937176ae9462027f63.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"晚吹 范明熙 （圖片來源：IG@vvvevila）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367273596374684_17873937176ae9462027f63.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@vvvevila）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367273850654884_6243140806ae94622c6199.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"晚吹 范明熙 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367273850654884_6243140806ae94622c6199.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T02:43:06.394588+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1436,"images":11,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T02:25:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T03:18:50.123184+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T02:39:21.811200+00:00","content_hash":"eeb1aa38d7cbf4323a0459ef431b7fe37c46eeb4c4c025a4b8bff08f49b4ec95","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}